{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "digischool-api-collection",
    "name": "DigiSchool API",
    "description": "Collection complète des API DigiSchool Backend\n\nVersion: 1.0.0\nBase URL: http://localhost:8080/api\n\n## Authentification\nLa plupart des endpoints nécessitent un token JWT.\n1. Utilisez /auth/login pour obtenir un token\n2. Le token est automatiquement stocké dans la variable {{access_token}}\n3. Les requêtes authentifiées utilisent ce token automatiquement",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
